    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27154" root="طنب" body-key="T">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَنِبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَنَبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَنَبٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a horse) <i>was
long in the back.</i> (O, Msb, TK.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَنَبٌ</span>
below: and see also 2.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And app., in like
manner said of a horse, <i>He was long and lax in
the hind legs.</i> See, again, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَنَبٌ</span> below.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
<i>It</i> (a spear) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, crooked.</i> (TK.)

